      "quote": "# Museum exhibit lookup"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0002",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 3,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 79,
      "quote": "A shared per-key query cache provides subscribe(key,options) -> unique observer"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0003",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 4,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 76,
      "quote": "handle, unsubscribe(handle), online(boolean), focus(boolean), snapshot(key),"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0004",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 5,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 80,
      "quote": "and dispose() of observer scopes. Queries retain status (pending/success/error),"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0005",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 6,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 76,
      "quote": "fetchStatus (idle/fetching/paused), and data. queryFn receives a lazy signal"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0006",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 7,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 80,
      "quote": "accessor. Each actual access records consumption; each fetch owns its controller"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0007",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 8,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 80,
      "quote": "and completion. Completion is asynchronous; initial online entry is synchronous,"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0008",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 9,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 77,
      "quote": "paused continuation resumes on a Promise turn. First start uses network mode;"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0009",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 10,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 78,
      "quote": "continuation also needs focus. 'always' can run offline; 'offlineFirst' allows"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0010",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 11,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 80,
      "quote": "first offline entry but retry can pause. Retries use explicit scheduler handles."
    },
    {
      "id": "S0011",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 12,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 80,
      "quote": "Multiple observers share one fetch. Unconsumed active work can finish into cache"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0012",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 13,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 75,
      "quote": "after its view departs; consumed work is physically abortable. Cancellation"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0013",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 14,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 76,
      "quote": "reverts previous query data/status and settles the originating attempt. Late"
    },
    {
      "id": "S0014",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 15,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 77,
      "quote": "fulfillment cannot become a new attempt's data. Unknown unsubscribe is inert."
    },
    {
      "id": "S0015",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 16,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 78,
      "quote": "The component owns observer scope; the cache remains outside individual views."
    },
    {
      "id": "S0016",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 17,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 78,
      "quote": "Dependency versions and build/test configuration are outside the repair scope."
    },
    {
      "id": "S0017",
      "file": "README.md",
      "line": 19,
      "start_column": 0,
      "end_column": 65,
      "quote": "Embedding API: bind registers a native callable; Environment.call"
    },
    {
